  "name": "Boeing 737 MAX N1 (modern)",
  "author": "FIPinator 3000",
  "description": "Boeing 737 MAX N1, glass-cockpit style: a dial per engine with a filled sweep and a digital box; red line 104.3. Limits: EASA TCDS E.115 (CFM LEAP-1B).",
